"ja\">性格</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいかく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">性格；性情；脾气；气质；特性；特征；性质</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">疑</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>怀疑；疑惑；不信；可疑；疑问</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うたが.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">疑う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うたがう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怀疑；不信任；猜疑；怀有疑心</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">疑問</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎもん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">疑问；疑惑；怀疑</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">疑惑</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎわく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怀疑；疑虑；不信任；猜疑</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">過</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>过度；超过；过错；度过；经过</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">す.ぎる・す.ごす・あやま.ち・あやま.つ・よぎ.る・よ.ぎる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">過ぎる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すぎる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">经过；通过；超越；流逝；消逝；期满；结束；完了；超过；超越；超出；不过是；仅仅；过度；太；过于</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">過去</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">过去；往日；昔日；（不愿为人所知的）往事；黑历史；过去时；过去式；前世；前生</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">通過</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">つうか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">通过（隧道、车站、城镇等）；经过；过境；通过（议案等）；批准；获得通过；通过（考试、检查等）；及格；获得资格</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">局</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>局；办公室；机构；宫廷女官；结局</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つぼね</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">郵便局</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうびんきょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">邮便局；邮局</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">局</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">局；部门；（邮局、电话局等）局；电视台；广播电台；频道；交换台；局面；情况；事态；局（围棋、将棋等的一盘）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">結局</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けっきょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">终究；到底；最后；最终；结局；结束；（围棋、将棋等棋类游戏的）终局</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">放</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>释放；发射；放逐；放任；排出</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はな.す・-っぱな.し・はな.つ・はな.れる・こ.く・ほう.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">放送</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほうそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">广播；播送；节目；公告</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">放す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はなす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">释放；放开；解放；放松；放出；（把茄子、土豆等）加入水、汤汁等中</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">解放</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいほう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">释放；解放；解除束缚；使自由；（计算机内存的）释放；解除分配</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">常</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>通常；经常；普通；不变；长久</p><dl class=\"k-yo