lass=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">関与</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんよ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">参与；参加；涉及</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">供</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>供奉；提供；陪同；随从；口供</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ・ク・クウ・グ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そな.える・とも・-ども</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">子供</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こども</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孩子；儿童</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">供給</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">供给</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">お供</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おとも</span><span class=\"k-wz\">随从；陪同者；伴随者</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">可</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>可以；许可；及格；可行</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カ・コク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">-べ.き・-べ.し</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">可</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">か</span><span class=\"k-wz\">可以；尚可；允许；许可；赞成；同意；赞成票；赞成的一票；及格；尚可；C等；D等</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">可能</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かのう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">可能的；潜在的；可行的；可实现的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">許可</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">许可；批准；授权；执照</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">役</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-leve