pan class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わ.る・わり・わ.り・わ.れる・さ.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">割合</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わりあい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">比率；比例；百分比；占比；相对地；比较；颇；出乎意料；与预期相反</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">割れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">われる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">破裂；碎裂；破损；裂开；开裂；龟裂；被撕裂；分裂；产生分歧；意见不一；显露；暴露；真相大白；败露；失真；破音；能整除；无余数地整除；跌破；降至最低限度以下</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">役割</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やくわり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">角色；职责；分工</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">身</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>身体；自身；身份；处境</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">み</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">身</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">み</span><span class=\"k-wz\">身体；身躯；自己；外表；仪表；身份；地位；主体部分；肉（相对于骨、皮等）；木质（相对于树皮）；刀身（相对于刀柄）；器身（相对于盖子）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">自身</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">自己；自身；你自己；他自己；她自己</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">出身</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅっしん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">出身；籍贯；身世</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">費</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>花费；消耗；浪费；费用</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヒ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つい.やす・つい.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">消費</span><s